# Emptiness evoked ({W/B}{W/B}) with Black Lotus's {W}{W}{W}: "if {W}{W} was spent to cast it" counts what was spent on the evoke
# cost too, so the reanimation triggers beside the evoke sacrifice trigger. Bot1 puts the reanimation first (a ruling lets the
# creature's own ability resolve before the evoke trigger), so the Llanowar Elves, in the graveyard from Faithless Looting,
# come back, and then Emptiness is sacrificed: it ends in the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Black Lotus
Faithless Looting
Emptiness
Island x3
Llanowar Elves
Island
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Llanowar Elves; Island)
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Hand.Emptiness.Cast(Ability: Evoke)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Ruby; Llanowar Elves
Bot1.Graveyard = Emptiness; Black Lotus; Faithless Looting; Island
